":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27301-shemihazazel","name":"shemihazazel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T13:47:47-07:00","id":1506987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shemihazazel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1506971-typos-in-night-horros-namless-and-accursed?p=1506981#post1506981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Holy hell I'm an idiot. I completely missed that it was intentional. Please excuse me while I proceed to put my palm through my face.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think one can understand if it is not fully intuitive to everybody to recognise non-binary and/or genderfluid pronouns, so long as it is apparent that there is no ill-meaning behind it.<br /> <br /> I like D'Eon. E's an interesting example of a Seer of the Throne who might not come across as conventionally evil, but manages to be strangely menacing even while you imagine e'd do it with a smile on eir face and no particular malice. It's not about you, it's about information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T16:17:28-07:00","id":1507002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1506971-typos-in-night-horros-namless-and-accursed?p=1506987#post1506987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think one can understand if it is not fully intuitive to everybody to recognise non-binary and/or genderfluid pronouns, so long as it is apparent that there is no ill-meaning behind it.<br /> <br /> I like D'Eon. E's an interesting example of a Seer of the Throne who might not come across as conventionally evil, but manages to be strangely menacing even while you imagine e'd do it with a smile on eir face and no particular malice. It's not about you, it's about information.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's partly why I feel so dumb. I have non-binary friends, so I'm very used to they/them/their. I'd just never seen these specific ones that chop the first letter or two off the &quot;normal&quot; version of the word. So I assumed it was some weird editting mistake. That, or my PDF reader was having a stroke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27301,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27301-shemihazazel","user":"shemihazazel","date":". 03-30-2023, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27301-shemihazazel","name":"shemihazazel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}